Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: add multi-camera simultaneous control (multi run /
 multi shell)

One process keeps BLE connections to several cameras open and dispatches
commands from a shared barrier (pkg/multi.FanOut). Every broadcast reports
per-camera dispatch offsets, RTTs and the overall dispatch spread, making
sync quality measurable instead of assumed. Includes unit tests and
doc/multi_camera.md.
